<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">02052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Trump's deadline for Iran's oil collapse has passed.</s> <s>The American blockade of Iranian ports aimed to fill global storage and force wellhead shutdowns, but Brent crude broke one hundred twenty-six dollars as the strategy stalled.</s> <s>Tehran hasn't capitulated, and the blockade continues even as fuel prices climb across every continent that didn't choose this war.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Red Square will run no tanks on the ninth of May.</s> <s>Russia's Defence Ministry cited the current operational situation, but armoured vehicles had featured every Victory Day parade since two thousand eight, and the Suvorov cadets every march since nineteen ninety-five.</s> <s>The Su-twenty-fives still fly, yet the broadcast cuts live to frontline positions — Moscow quietly editing its annual self-portrait of military power.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The al-Qaeda affiliate JNIM has seized Tessalit and ringed Bamako with checkpoints.</s> <s>Mali's junta expelled French forces precisely to defeat this insurgency, yet four northern bases are now in rebel hands and the capital itself is encircled.</s> <s>The junta has not responded, and the Russian African Corps that replaced the French disputes any losses on the ground.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Rapid Support Forces raids have emptied villages across Tina, in North Darfur.</s> <s>An unattributed drone strike destroyed a UN aid truck bound for Tawila, and the same forces seized Keili in Blue Nile state, pushing toward Kurmuk.</s> <s>A Darfur civilians' group has called for international intervention — a call that, two years into this war, no capital has answered.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saif Gadhafi's killers are named inside a Tripoli case file.</s> <s>The third of February hit was solved forensically within weeks, but the named suspects sit behind militia factions Libya's fragmented government cannot coerce.</s> <s>Fifteen years after NATO's intervention, no state body holds the authority to prosecute across factional lines — accountability needs a state, and Libya hasn't reconstituted one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The British Museum has changed the word Palestinian to Canaanite on a label about the Hyksos.</s> <s>The caption shifted after UK Lawyers for Israel lobbied the institution, and the museum hasn't named who made the decision.</s> <s>Palestine's ambassador has raised the case with the British Foreign Office, and the museum has not replied.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bengal has cut its vote-counting centres from eighty-seven to seventy-seven without explanation.</s> <s>India's Election Commission has rolled out QR-coded photo IDs at the innermost scrutiny layer for the first time, scanning every authorised person before entry.</s> <s>Trinamool Congress challenged the reduction days before the fourth of May results across five states — the largest single-day vote outside a general election.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Trump raised tariffs on European cars and trucks to twenty-five percent.</s> <s>The Turnberry Agreement had set a fifteen-percent ceiling, but Washington then expanded steel tariffs unilaterally — which Brussels says violates the deal outright.</s> <s>The European Parliament's trade chief called the United States an unreliable partner, language a sitting EU body has rarely used about its closest ally.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Banned syringes are still circulating across Pakistan's clinics.</s> <s>The Pakistan Medical Association blamed the country's Drug Regulatory Authority for what it called a catastrophic failure, in a country that already carries the world's second-highest hepatitis C burden.</s> <s>Three hundred fifty thousand Pakistanis live with HIV, and Sindh's outbreak figures keep climbing — a man-made epidemic that the regulator has not stopped.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombia seized four hundred forty-five tons of cocaine last year.</s> <s>The fifty-nine percent jump reflects enforcement pushing trafficking toward weaker-state corridors, with liquid cocaine increasingly slipping past modern port scanners.</s> <s>Half of Latin America saw seizures fall in the same year — meaning the trade hasn't shrunk, it's simply relocated to states with thinner customs.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi Arabia posted two-point-eight percent growth in the first quarter.</s> <s>The result came as Gulf shipping disruptions from the Iran war suppressed activity across bystander economies that had nothing to do with the fighting.</s> <s>Riyadh provided no sector breakdown and signalled no policy adjustment — an unusually quiet response from a kingdom that normally choreographs its numbers.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Half the species at a newly studied site in southern China are new to science.</s> <s>The lagerstätte preserves soft-tissue Cambrian fauna from a stage once thought impossible to fossilise, bridging the gap toward the Ordovician diversification of animal life.</s> <s>The find rewrites textbook timelines of how quickly the animal kingdom actually branched.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>AI systems now sort asylum claims ahead of human caseworkers across Europe and North America.</s> <s>The efficiency gain is real, but what's lost is discretionary mercy — the judgment that tips borderline cases toward protection, the kind of decision a classifier cannot articulate.</s> <s>No legal standard yet requires an algorithm to explain why it refused a displaced person shelter.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Belgium has signed to nationalise ENGIE's seven-reactor fleet.</s> <s>Parliament reversed the country's two thousand three nuclear phase-out last year, after Belgium found itself running on gas imports it could no longer afford and renewables it hadn't built fast enough.</s> <s>A basic agreement with ENGIE is due by October, and Prime Minister De Wever's government plans new reactors beyond it — the second European country to walk back its phase-out.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American hyperscalers are quietly routing Gulf data through Iraq.</s> <s>Subsea cables across the Gulf face Iran-war disruption, and Iraq's overland fibre has become the backup corridor for United States cloud traffic.</s> <s>Baghdad's terms for hosting critical global internet infrastructure haven't been reported, in sha'Allah they will be soon.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon has cleared eight AI firms for classified military networks.</s> <s>OpenAI, Google, SpaceX, and five others accepted an any-lawful-use clause, but Anthropic refused the language and now faces a ban from Defense Department systems.</s> <s>Anthropic's legal challenge reaches court in September, with one-point-three million Defense personnel and the future shape of military AI hanging on the outcome.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>